  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nWitch’s Cabin Cleanup is a cozy organizing simulator about putting a cluttered witch’s cabin back in order. Sort 5,313 curios across 6 rooms: the apothecary, the library, the greenhouse, the ritual chamber, and more. All at your own pace.<p></p>\n<p><b>A Relaxing Witch’s Cabin Organizing Simulator</b><br>\nThe cabin is a mess, and the magic only made it worse. Return everything to its proper shelf at your own pace, with no timers and no pressure.</p>\n<p>Pick up each item: a potion vial, a loose spellbook, or a jar of moth wings, find the room and shelf it belongs on, and set it in place. Work through the cabin one shelf at a time.</p>\n<p>Earn upgrades as you play. Move faster, reach farther, and unlock a few small spells: a levitation charm, a banishing wand, that make tidying the cabin quicker.</p>\n<p>Cluttered shelves fill with neat rows of labelled jars, and the tangled herb rack settles into order. Each finished room shows clear progress.</p>\n<p><b>Key Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sort more than 5,300 curios across 6 rooms of a witch’s cabin\n</li><li>Simple gameplay: pick things up and put them back where they belong\n</li><li>Skill upgrades for speed and reach, plus a few magical abilities\n</li><li>No time limits and no game over. A relaxed pace you set yourself\n</li></ul>\n",
